{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/bot_surfaces/tests.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-12T06:06:30.833707Z","id":"11cc73fe811ed22dccbaa76d7d2ccd1e081ac1bf93b5ed09720b2ac829b5a0ae","body":{"detail":"generated(seed, steps) mixes Accepted, errors, results and RetryAfter in random orders and serves (bot_surfaces/tests.rs, `retry: Retry::NONE` near line 2694), the fixture replay (Replay, near line 257) and crates/clax-server/tests/api_bot_surfaces.rs (`retry: Retry::NONE` in Daemon) likewise. Run under Retry::DAEMON with an invariant 'an accepted call of an @once operation is never delivered again', the generator would have found the one-serve `accepted` then retryable error case recorded as a blocker on bot_surfaces.rs:2611:2620.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":2477},"end":{"line":2480},"content_hash":"e69cbd4d699f94945138b37ca86ff2c1282f56c092c0eb8c0d9e918dce79931f"},"summary":"The generated sequences of answers, the fixture's replay and the HTTP daemon test all open their calls under `Retry::NONE`, so none of them exercises sending again","tags":["claxbot-surfaces","retries","tests","session:claude-code:443e6ffa-9215-48fe-9313-5be76354ae11"]}}
